{"id":"546881747fec","path":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/contacts","lang":"en","title":"Contact us","description":"Get in touch with the Master in Public Management and Policy (PMP). Here you will find whom to contact for any information about the programme.","section":"Education","crumbs":["Education","Master","PMP"],"image":null,"words":144,"alternates":{"it":"/it/formazione/master/public-management-and-policy/contatti","en":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/contacts"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Education","path":"/en/originalnode/8525"},{"label":"Master","path":"/en/originalnode/7757"},{"label":"PMP","path":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy"},{"label":"Contact us","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>Scientific team</strong></p> <p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/it/persone/1adcd6de7e071194c9ad416a5b3b9ab4/jametti-mario\">Mario Jametti</a> and <a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/it/persone/1957250b90ba5a5f45ba0c141d9d7b7b/villeneuve-jean-patrick\">Jean-Patrick Villeneuve</a>, Co-Directors of the PMP Master’s Programme </p> <p><a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/it/persone/40e6778be61d00c579d21a0dfacb1329/barreca-manuela\">Manuela Barreca</a>, Scientific Coordinator of the PMP Master’s Programme</p> <p><strong>USI Master PMP in Public Management and Policy community</strong></p> <p>Join the USI Master in Public Management and Policy community on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/usi_pmp\">Instagram</a> and <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/groups/8536772/\">LinkedIn</a> to receive the latest updates on the program and campus life in Lugano.</p> <p>Curious to find out what it means to be part of the Public Management and Policy network in Switzerland? Watch our video on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vDwUsayDVJs\">YouTube</a>.</p> <p><strong>Visit the Lugano Campus</strong></p> <p>Would you like to learn more about the PMP Master’s Program and meet us in person at our Lugano campus?</p> <p>The Study Advisory organises several <a href=\"/en/originalnode/7759\">Open Days</a> and it is available for and offers prospective students individual consultations by <a href=\"https://join.usi.ch/en/book-a-meeting\">appoitment</a>.</p> <p>If you want to arrange a campus visit, you can write to <a href=\"mailto:pmp@usi.ch\">pmp@usi.ch</a>.</p>"}],"ctas":[{"label":"Apply Now","href":"/en/education-application"},{"label":"Learn More","href":"mailto:pmp@usi.ch?subject=Learn More"}],"nav":[{"label":"Master in Public Management and Policy (PMP)","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy"},{"label":"Study plan","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/structure-and-contents"},{"label":"Employability","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/career-prospects"},{"label":"Job Profiles","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/career-prospects/job-profiles"},{"label":"Employers","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/career-prospects/employers"},{"label":"Career Stories","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/career-prospects/career-stories"},{"label":"Admission and application","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/admission"},{"label":"Fees and grants","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/fees-and-grants"},{"label":"Practical information","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/organising-your-studies"},{"label":"Open days and study advisory","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/open-days-study-advisory"},{"label":"Contact us","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/contacts"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/faq"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/education/master/public-management-and-policy/contacts","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:36:35.484Z"}